	(text "Probe helper (docs/probe-helper-pi.md, tools/probe_ads1263.py). Plugs into the Waveshare High-Precision\nAD HAT's 13-way 3.5 mm screw terminal (J1) and takes 8 Pi GPIOs over a 10-way ribbon from the HAT's\npass-through header (J2). Each range is a GPIO divider: top GPIO high + bottom GPIO low puts its node\nN at 3.3 V x 47 / 1247 = 0.12 V behind ~45 R; both GPIOs as inputs (no pull) float it. The ADC reads\nN and both probe nodes; IDAC 1 mA out of IN3 (A) or IN1 (B) for the diode test."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "921489ed-eeef-4d8d-87b9-60e0af35f3d1")
	)
