	(text "D1-D4 clamp the probe nodes to GND and +5 V (AVDD). At the 10 M range\nthe clamps' leakage adds to the nA signal: if R reads finite with the\nprobes open, fit low-leakage DO-35 diodes (1N3595, BAS45A) for D1/D2."
